TITLE=E2E-66: Self-hosted cost shows when the model is priced (#231)
TAGS=cost,pricing,selfhosted,correctness
MODE=dashboard
BODY=On a self-hosted server, run reviews on a priced Anthropic ID, on an unpriced model with a .mergewatch.yml pricing: override, and on a 0/0 local model; confirm Est. cost in the PR comment + non-zero dashboard Total spend, that malformed override entries are skipped, that 0/0 counts as priced $0, and that an all-unpriced window shows the actionable pricing: hint plus one-time [cost] warn. No fixture PR.
